{"id":13904,"artist":"Gigi.","title":"I Remember It Well","lyrics_plain":"We met at nine.\nWe met at eight.\nI was on time.\nNo, you were late.\nAh, yes! I remember it well.\nWe dined with friends.\nWe dined alone.\nA tenor sang.\nA baritone.\nAh, yes! I remember it well.\nThat dazzling April moon.\nThere was none that night,\nand the month was June.\nThat's right! That's right!\nIt warms my heart to know that you\nremember still the way you do.\nAh, yes! I remember it well.\nHow often I've thought of that Friday\nMonday, night,\nWhen we had our last rendezvous,\nand somehow I've foolishly\nwondered if you might\nby some chance be thinking of it, too.\nThat carriage ride.\nYou walked me home.\nYou lost a glove.\nI lost a comb.\nAh, yes! I remember it well.\nThat brilliant sky.\nWe had some rain.\nThose Russian songs.\nFrom sunny Spain?\nAh, yes! I remember it well.\nYou wore a gown of gold.\nI was all in blue.\nAm I getting old?\nOh no! Not you!\nHow strong you were, how young and gay,\na prince of love in every way.\nAh, yes! I remember it well.","lyrics_synced":"[00:00.00] [Maurice] We met at nine.\n[00:01.55] [Hermione] We met at eight.\n[00:03.10] [Maurice] I was on time.\n[00:04.66] [Hermione] No, you were late.\n[00:06.47] [Maurice] Ah, yes! I remember it well.\n[00:12.41] [Maurice] We dined with friends.\n[00:13.97] [Hermione] We dined alone.\n[00:15.52] [Maurice] A tenor sang.\n[00:17.07] [Hermione] A baritone.\n[00:18.88] [Maurice] Ah, yes! I remember it well.\n[00:25.09] [Maurice] That dazzling April moon.\n[00:28.71] [Hermione] There was none that night,\n[00:31.81] [Hermione] and the month was June.\n[00:34.66] [Maurice] That's right! That's right!\n[00:37.24] [Hermione] It warms my heart to know that you\n[00:40.34] remember still the way you do.\n[00:43.71] [Maurice] Ah, yes! I remember it well.\n[00:53.28] [Maurice] How often I've thought of that Friday\n[00:57.16] [Hermione] Monday, [Maurice] night,\n[00:59.48] [Maurice] When we had our last rendezvous,\n[01:05.43] [Maurice] and somehow I've foolishly\n[01:09.05] wondered if you might\n[01:11.90] by some chance be thinking of it, too.\n[01:17.59] [Maurice] That carriage ride.\n[01:19.14] [Hermione] You walked me home.\n[01:20.69] [Maurice] You lost a glove.\n[01:22.24] [Hermione] I lost a comb.\n[01:24.05] [Maurice] Ah, yes! I remember it well.\n[01:30.00] [Maurice] That brilliant sky.\n[01:31.55] [Hermione] We had some rain.\n[01:33.10] [Maurice] Those Russian songs.\n[01:34.66] [Hermione] From sunny Spain?\n[01:36.47] [Maurice] Ah, yes! I remember it well.\n[01:42.67] [Maurice] You wore a gown of gold.\n[01:46.29] [Hermione] I was all in blue.\n[01:49.40] [Maurice] Am I getting old?\n[01:52.24] [Hermione] Oh no! Not you!\n[01:54.83] [Hermione] How strong you were, how young and gay,\n[01:57.93] a prince of love in every way.\n[02:01.29] [Maurice] Ah, yes! I remember it well.","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:00.00] <00:00.00>[Maurice] We <00:00.25>met <00:00.51>at <00:00.77>nine.\n[00:01.55] <00:01.55>[Hermione] We <00:01.81>met <00:02.06>at <00:02.32>eight.\n[00:03.10] <00:03.10>[Maurice] I <00:03.36>was <00:03.62>on <00:03.87>time.\n[00:04.65] <00:04.65>[Hermione] No, <00:04.91>you <00:05.17>were <00:05.43>late.\n[00:06.46] <00:06.46>[Maurice] Ah, yes! <00:07.75>I <00:08.01>re <00:08.53>mem <00:09.05>ber <00:09.56>it <00:10.08>well.\n[00:12.41] <00:12.41>[Maurice] We <00:12.67>dined <00:12.93>with <00:13.18>friends.\n[00:13.96] <00:13.96>[Hermione] We <00:14.22>dined <00:14.48>a <00:14.74>lone.\n[00:15.51] <00:15.51>[Maurice] A <00:15.77>te <00:16.03>nor <00:16.29>sang.\n[00:17.06] <00:17.06>[Hermione] A <00:17.32>ba <00:17.58>ri <00:17.84>tone.\n[00:18.87] <00:18.87>[Maurice] Ah, <00:19.39>yes! <00:20.17>I <00:20.43>re <00:20.94>mem <00:21.46>ber <00:21.98>it <00:22.49>well.\n[00:25.08] <00:25.08>[Maurice] That <00:25.60>daz <00:25.86>zling <00:26.12>A <00:26.63>pril <00:27.15>moon.\n[00:28.70] <00:28.70>[Hermione] There <00:28.96>was <00:29.22>none <00:29.74